<title>USA: Cool weather expected in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</title>
<headline>Cool weather expected in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostly fair and cool weather is forecast for Brazil's coffee growing areas Thursday and Friday but no damaging cold is expected, forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Temperatures are expected to be below normal with lows in the 40s to low 50s.</p>
<p>The outlook for Saturday-Monday is similar.</p>
</text>
